This is a '''list of quotes by {{ai|Sova}}'''. Sova is voiced by Aaron Vodovoz in English. Necessary quotes are translated from Russian to English. Sova has a total of {{PAGESINCATEGORY:Sova Quotes}} files of quotes including unused and removed lines, and excluding [[#The Range's lore assets|The Range's lore assets]].

A downloadable folder containing all the audio files on this page can be found [https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11jWv4Oe-fXM5kYpo5tpASz1i_pJQMfcc?usp=sharing here].

