==Buy Phase==
===Match Start===
*{{AC|SovaMatchStart1.mp3}} "This bow has taken man and beast alike. I have found there is little difference."
*{{AC|SovaMatchStart2.mp3}} "There is no retreat. Not when annihilation is at stake. This is our day."
*{{AC|SovaMatchStart3.mp3}} "Don't be afraid. I've gone through rifts before."
*{{AC|SovaMatchStart4.mp3}} "I believe in all of you, like I believe in myself."
*{{AC|SovaMatchStart5.mp3}} "I was told you are all the best. That is why I'm here."
*{{AC|SovaMatchStart6.mp3}} "You'll have your intel. I promise."
*{{AC|SovaMatchStart7.mp3}} "You have me. That is good for you."
*{{AC|SovaMatchStart8.mp3}} "Another day, another battle. So be it. I do not fear blood on my hands."

====Attacking====
*{{AC|SovaMatchStartAttack1.mp3}} "Remember, the enemy defends this world. It is their home, and that makes them dangerous."
*{{AC|SovaMatchStartAttack2.mp3}} "We will not withdraw until their radianite is ours."

====Defending====
